  "content": "<h1>Code block examples</h1>\n<p>Use these samples to verify language labels, syntax highlighting, horizontal overflow, and copying.</p>\n<h2>JSON</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  &quot;host&quot;: &quot;localhost&quot;,\n  &quot;port&quot;: 8080,\n  &quot;features&quot;: [&quot;search&quot;, &quot;themes&quot;]\n}\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Bash</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\nservef ./docs --port 8080\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Shell</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-shell\">servef ./docs --no-open\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Unknown language</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-custom-format\">unknown &lt;syntax&gt; remains safely escaped\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Unlabelled</h2>\n<pre><code>plain text still supports copying\n</code></pre>\n",
  "source": "# Code block examples\n\nUse these samples to verify language labels, syntax highlighting, horizontal overflow, and copying.\n\n## JSON\n\n```json\n{\n  \"host\": \"localhost\",\n  \"port\": 8080,\n  \"features\": [\"search\", \"themes\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Bash\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\nservef ./docs --port 8080\n```\n\n## Shell\n\n```shell\nservef ./docs --no-open\n```\n\n## Unknown language\n\n```custom-format\nunknown <syntax> remains safely escaped\n```\n\n## Unlabelled\n\n```\nplain text still supports copying\n```\n",
